WEBVTT

01:50.040 --> 01:51.720
Little one, you've got quite the appetite.

01:54.760 --> 01:57.120
Here. Have something sour
to cut through the grease.

01:58.080 --> 01:59.920
Thank you, Mr. Yang. I'm full.

02:00.000 --> 02:01.960
-Good.
-Settle the bill.

02:02.040 --> 02:04.480
Your father and I were like brothers.
No need to pay.

02:05.080 --> 02:06.760
Father is Father. I am me.

02:06.840 --> 02:08.520
I don't like owing anyone anything.

02:09.479 --> 02:10.600
I'm leaving, Mr. Yang.

02:10.680 --> 02:11.560
WONTON SHOP

02:11.640 --> 02:13.480
No. Take all of it.

02:15.800 --> 02:19.120
This boy. Who knows
what he'll be like when he grows up.

02:26.760 --> 02:28.760
Sir, take care.

02:31.600 --> 02:34.760
ALL-GOODS SHOP

02:38.320 --> 02:40.840
The pageboy hid himself
in the Cangshui River.

02:40.920 --> 02:42.240
Is he all right?

02:42.320 --> 02:44.720
All right? He was howling nonstop.

02:44.800 --> 02:48.320
To keep me from getting out,
he nearly chewed through the skiff.

02:48.400 --> 02:49.920
Speaking of which,

02:50.000 --> 02:52.400
you really mean to entrust
something this important to him?

02:54.360 --> 02:56.040
He's the only one who can pull it off.

03:07.920 --> 03:09.600
He's not Huben.

03:09.680 --> 03:11.320
He's someone
who admires your junior sister.

03:16.200 --> 03:17.480
I've seen him.

03:18.280 --> 03:20.480
He serves at Yang Chuhao's side.

03:22.600 --> 03:23.840
What did you just say?

03:24.400 --> 03:25.520
He admires Xiaoqing?

03:26.320 --> 03:27.160
With eyes like that,

03:27.240 --> 03:29.000
he should see a physician.

03:30.120 --> 03:32.320
Xiaoqing is a good girl.

03:32.400 --> 03:33.280
Don't talk too much.

03:44.000 --> 03:46.560
Xiaoqing was never skilled
in music, chess, calligraphy, or painting.

03:46.640 --> 03:47.480
But she loves her food.

03:48.080 --> 03:49.800
So you should cater to what she likes.

03:51.840 --> 03:55.000
Then may I ask, sir,
what she likes to eat and drink?

03:55.080 --> 03:56.600
Could you give me some guidance?

03:59.000 --> 04:00.360
I'm not sure about that.

04:00.440 --> 04:04.320
But girls tend to like
a bit of something sweet.

04:06.040 --> 04:07.360
Thank you, sir.

04:09.120 --> 04:10.480
You blockhead.

04:11.280 --> 04:12.120
Thanks.

04:19.680 --> 04:23.640
WONTONS

04:25.040 --> 04:26.800
Sir, please come inside.

04:28.920 --> 04:30.080
You are here.

04:30.600 --> 04:31.480
Have a seat.

04:31.560 --> 04:33.200
-All right.
-I'll get you a bowl of wontons.

04:34.400 --> 04:35.600
Take care, young lady.

04:36.800 --> 04:37.880
Come again anytime.

04:37.960 --> 04:38.960
Take care.

04:43.000 --> 04:45.760
Have a look.

04:48.800 --> 04:49.840
Here.

04:50.680 --> 04:51.600
Good.

04:54.080 --> 04:54.920
Boss.

04:55.640 --> 04:58.440
For the past two weeks,
you've been wearing that gloomy face.

05:00.360 --> 05:01.480
Is it so obvious?

05:01.560 --> 05:02.560
Of course.

05:08.320 --> 05:11.760
Boss, Su came looking for me on purpose.

05:12.400 --> 05:15.360
He said, you and I were old acquaintances,

05:16.320 --> 05:19.600
so he asked if I had any way
to ease your worries.

05:21.000 --> 05:22.400
That boy.

05:23.560 --> 05:26.800
Well, what advice did you,
my old partner, give him?

05:28.600 --> 05:29.440
None.

05:30.040 --> 05:32.920
I told him the boss
is not an ordinary man.

05:33.840 --> 05:37.480
What troubles the boss
can only be solved by Heaven.

05:42.240 --> 05:43.200
Boss.

05:43.720 --> 05:48.080
We've both lived several decades,
one way or another.

05:49.080 --> 05:52.520
When it comes to matters
truly hard to decide, I think

05:54.880 --> 05:55.920
this is the only way.

06:03.960 --> 06:07.120
Sha is also one of the Liu faction.

06:07.200 --> 06:08.840
You've been the one sheltering him.

06:08.920 --> 06:13.080
So in some way,
you are a man who remembers past ties.

06:14.320 --> 06:15.560
A man of feeling.

06:16.120 --> 06:17.720
I do not wish for him to die.

06:18.640 --> 06:20.040
What happens next

06:22.080 --> 06:23.800
I must leave to you, Mr. Yang.

06:23.880 --> 06:29.000
At our age,
we don't have many friends left.

06:32.160 --> 06:35.280
You must not let anything happen to you.

06:47.560 --> 06:50.560
Heads, and I enjoy wealth and peace.

06:51.640 --> 06:55.240
Tails, and I repay my debts.

07:19.040 --> 07:20.080
Stop.

07:27.360 --> 07:30.680
This city wall can't stop me,
and it won't trap you either.

07:33.440 --> 07:35.240
Rest assured. Don't be afraid.

08:22.320 --> 08:23.680
I had been thinking

08:25.480 --> 08:27.600
that after you woke up,
I wouldn't know how to face you.

08:28.920 --> 08:30.200
You are the Emperor.

08:30.720 --> 08:32.960
I am nothing more than a commoner.

08:39.440 --> 08:40.840
Should I call you Wuyang,

08:42.720 --> 08:44.039
or Your Majesty?

08:46.760 --> 08:47.760
I don't know.

08:53.320 --> 08:54.600
But now it's settled.

08:56.240 --> 08:57.480
We're parting ways,

08:59.760 --> 09:01.120
and you're still not awake.

09:04.960 --> 09:06.280
But I still have other matters

09:07.640 --> 09:09.240
and must leave Cangshui River for now.

09:12.000 --> 09:15.440
From here on in, Mr. Long
will send people to look after you.

09:27.960 --> 09:28.920
Don't worry.

09:51.960 --> 09:52.800
Wuyang.

09:54.360 --> 09:55.960
If I come back alive,

09:57.400 --> 09:58.640
I'll go on taking care of you.

10:03.080 --> 10:04.360
If I die,

10:06.240 --> 10:08.120
it will count as a valiant death
for the realm

10:09.640 --> 10:11.400
and I won't have disgraced our Xiao clan.

10:18.480 --> 10:19.400
I'm leaving.

10:37.440 --> 10:38.280
Wuyang,

10:39.840 --> 10:41.320
when you're not holding a blade,

10:42.680 --> 10:44.160
you're actually easy to get along with.

11:08.920 --> 11:10.280
-Here.
-Thank you.

11:16.160 --> 11:17.200
Where is he?

11:24.960 --> 11:26.760
Are you the lad from the salt shop?

11:26.840 --> 11:28.080
Sir.

11:29.600 --> 11:30.520
I'll take it.

11:30.600 --> 11:32.880
So you still know how to show your face.

11:34.080 --> 11:36.880
You've skipped work for days on end.

11:36.960 --> 11:40.400
Are you planning to quit on me?

11:41.200 --> 11:43.680
No, sir. Something came up at home.

11:44.800 --> 11:46.880
You smell of medicine.

11:46.960 --> 11:47.960
What is it?

11:48.040 --> 11:49.560
Is your family member gravely ill again?

11:50.160 --> 11:51.800
Do you have enough money for the medicine?

11:52.320 --> 11:54.720
If not, I'll lend you some.

11:55.440 --> 11:56.720
It's not that.

11:56.800 --> 11:59.160
Forget it, go on in. Go inside.

11:59.240 --> 12:00.080
All right.

12:00.800 --> 12:01.840
Here.

12:01.920 --> 12:03.400
Have some tea.

12:12.680 --> 12:14.680
Drink a little. Warm yourself up.

12:16.120 --> 12:18.280
You really don't seem short on money.

12:21.360 --> 12:22.560
Look at you.

12:22.640 --> 12:24.240
A whole new outfit.

12:25.480 --> 12:26.760
New clothes.

12:31.520 --> 12:33.560
All dressed up all of a sudden.

12:33.640 --> 12:35.760
You must have someone you fancy.

12:37.680 --> 12:39.200
That's not why.

12:40.840 --> 12:44.720
This time I'm here to bid you farewell.

12:49.160 --> 12:50.600
I'm going to Chang'an.

12:53.240 --> 12:56.760
Before I leave,
I want to admit a wrong to you.

13:00.000 --> 13:01.440
This clothing is for you.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.840
I noticed your clothes were patched up.

13:04.920 --> 13:06.000
So I bought new ones for you.

13:08.440 --> 13:12.320
All this for the salt
you always sneak off with?

13:13.280 --> 13:18.240
This fine clothing will settle the debt.

13:20.240 --> 13:21.720
So you knew all along.

13:23.800 --> 13:27.240
But this time,
it isn't just because of that salt.

13:39.880 --> 13:41.200
What are you doing?

13:46.480 --> 13:47.440
Because

13:51.760 --> 13:53.680
I know you're Zhang Mo's father.

14:04.440 --> 14:08.360
And because you knew I was the killer
yet never blamed me.

14:09.200 --> 14:11.520
You even let me stay here,
letting me work to earn money.

14:15.320 --> 14:17.600
And when I nodded off in laziness,

14:19.320 --> 14:20.800
you covered me with your coat.

14:22.160 --> 14:26.600
You sewed the old family letters
Zhang Mo wrote into that coat.

14:29.600 --> 14:31.200
When I patched it up,

14:33.400 --> 14:35.400
I learned who you were.

14:40.720 --> 14:42.440
It's fate.

14:47.920 --> 14:49.440
It's truly fate.

14:52.240 --> 14:54.200
If you'd stabbed me a few times,

14:55.560 --> 14:57.680
I might have felt better.

15:00.360 --> 15:02.480
But instead you kept taking care of me,

15:07.200 --> 15:08.880
leaving me ashamed.

15:11.800 --> 15:13.480
I came to Cangshui River

15:14.720 --> 15:17.080
with hatred in my heart.

15:18.600 --> 15:22.360
Before you came to work in my salt shop,

15:22.440 --> 15:26.960
I had already watched you for many days.

15:34.840 --> 15:36.320
But I found…

15:37.480 --> 15:41.280
I found you were just a foolish lad.

15:43.960 --> 15:47.920
Always complaining with your mouth,

15:48.000 --> 15:52.640
yet in your heart
always thinking of others.

15:53.440 --> 15:55.480
Caring for the sick at home,

15:57.480 --> 15:58.560
hoping

16:00.880 --> 16:04.760
a lost friend would show up again soon.

16:12.080 --> 16:13.000
You…

16:16.800 --> 16:19.120
The less you seem like a bad person,

16:20.200 --> 16:22.600
the harder it is for me to hate you.

16:30.440 --> 16:33.240
If only you had never learned who I was.

16:36.640 --> 16:40.240
You did not know,
and I would not have exposed it.

16:41.680 --> 16:45.360
Day after day,
life could have just gone on like that.

16:47.200 --> 16:48.440
Forget it.

16:48.520 --> 16:49.600
It felt as if

16:52.160 --> 16:56.120
Zhang Mo were still here by my side.

16:59.160 --> 17:02.560
You may pour the salt
back into the funnel,

17:05.520 --> 17:07.839
but time cannot be turned back.

17:16.640 --> 17:19.160
I truly wanted to kill you.

17:20.880 --> 17:24.040
But child, what use is it if I kill you?

17:25.560 --> 17:28.040
Zhang Mo will not come back to life.

17:34.400 --> 17:35.520
Zhang Mo

17:37.480 --> 17:40.280
was ordinary to begin with.

17:43.200 --> 17:44.560
In this world,

17:45.480 --> 17:48.920
nothing is ever that perfect.

18:11.480 --> 18:12.960
Listen well.

18:14.280 --> 18:18.080
If you can do something great
to help restore the realm,

18:18.920 --> 18:20.360
to support the state,

18:21.040 --> 18:24.240
then Zhang Mo will not have died in vain.

18:27.760 --> 18:28.960
Get up.

18:31.120 --> 18:31.960
Sir.

18:32.480 --> 18:33.600
Sir.

18:35.800 --> 18:36.920
I am sorry.

18:39.120 --> 18:40.400
Get up.

18:52.560 --> 18:54.040
Remember.

18:55.000 --> 18:56.520
From this day on,

18:58.440 --> 19:01.240
you must live an honest and upright life.

19:07.560 --> 19:08.520
All right.

19:15.240 --> 19:19.560
WEI HOUR

19:20.280 --> 19:24.440
Then, I will say something unpleasant.

19:25.800 --> 19:29.840
The human heart
always carries its darkness.

19:30.440 --> 19:31.480
You have it.

19:32.440 --> 19:33.680
I have it too.

19:35.400 --> 19:36.920
But do not be afraid.

19:38.040 --> 19:40.200
No matter how dark it becomes,

19:41.960 --> 19:45.000
just like this Cangshui River,

19:45.080 --> 19:47.200
your heart must always

19:48.240 --> 19:49.800
hold a single light.

19:53.440 --> 19:54.520
I understand.

19:55.120 --> 19:55.960
All right.

19:57.120 --> 19:58.040
Go on.

19:59.240 --> 20:00.120
Take this.

20:00.640 --> 20:01.920
Eat it on the road.

20:04.880 --> 20:06.200
Go on.

20:07.320 --> 20:09.920
You are going to Chang'an
to do something important.

20:10.000 --> 20:11.240
Do not delay it.

20:14.360 --> 20:15.200
Go.

20:19.560 --> 20:21.680
I have seen you now.

20:21.760 --> 20:23.720
My heart is settled.

20:24.920 --> 20:26.240
We part here.

20:26.880 --> 20:27.760
Go.

20:46.040 --> 20:46.920
Sir.

21:40.680 --> 21:42.560
STONE-BAKED FLATBREAD

21:44.560 --> 21:46.120
ZUIFENG TOWER

21:46.200 --> 21:47.800
THE MERRY HOUSE, SKYWAY

22:33.840 --> 22:34.960
Mr. Yang.

22:35.920 --> 22:39.160
This street has suddenly gone quiet.

22:45.600 --> 22:46.840
Have you thought it through?

22:48.160 --> 22:51.760
What Yan Fengshan
plans to discuss with the Tiemo people

22:52.520 --> 22:53.880
is no small matter.

22:55.240 --> 22:59.320
If you stir up trouble now,
kidnap the Tiemo envoy,

23:01.600 --> 23:03.120
and something unexpected happens,

23:03.200 --> 23:06.200
it is not only
Yan Fengshan who will come after you.

23:06.280 --> 23:09.040
Even Tiemo assassins

23:09.120 --> 23:12.880
will travel all the way
to Chang'an to kill you.

23:18.960 --> 23:21.480
What Yan Fengshan wants to discuss
with the Tiemo people

23:22.720 --> 23:25.440
is nothing more than persuading them
to send troops

23:26.480 --> 23:27.680
to attack the Baiwenhu Army.

23:30.720 --> 23:33.400
He plans to trade away northern territory,

23:34.960 --> 23:35.800
right?

23:41.920 --> 23:44.080
The north is Xiao Wuyang's fief.

23:44.160 --> 23:45.320
It is difficult to conquer.

23:45.400 --> 23:49.720
So why not give it to the Tiemo people

23:51.120 --> 23:53.480
and let them burn it barren?

23:54.400 --> 23:58.200
This scheme of Yan Fengshan
is not hard to guess.

23:58.960 --> 24:00.280
As for my plan,

24:00.960 --> 24:05.840
I only want the Tiemo envoy
to meet with me once

24:07.040 --> 24:08.480
before he meets Yan Fengshan.

24:09.520 --> 24:14.200
After that, he can return
wholly unscathed to Yan Fengshan's side.

24:14.280 --> 24:16.800
You want to negotiate
with the Tiemo envoy?

24:17.880 --> 24:20.120
Can you bear the cost?

24:25.000 --> 24:26.560
Naturally I cannot.

24:35.680 --> 24:37.400
But someone can.

24:42.960 --> 24:46.200
SILK AND SATIN

24:59.800 --> 25:01.080
CHANGXING WORKS

25:05.160 --> 25:08.200
Chen Zhiying of the Huben Army
welcomes you here, Mr. Wuyin.

25:15.960 --> 25:16.880
Sir.

25:19.120 --> 25:20.080
I recognize her.

25:20.680 --> 25:22.120
She is indeed from the Huben Army.

25:28.400 --> 25:29.640
Thank you.

25:45.640 --> 25:48.760
Given the hour, I should take my leave.

25:50.800 --> 25:51.640
You?

25:53.640 --> 25:54.600
Surprised?

25:55.640 --> 25:59.520
A man who lays the plan
must step forward himself,

26:00.280 --> 26:04.280
or else who would follow him in?

26:05.440 --> 26:10.280
But I heard that you do not know
any martial arts.

26:17.560 --> 26:19.160
I have a stubborn life.

26:26.000 --> 26:27.320
I am not meant to die yet.

26:48.920 --> 26:50.760
This street is not the same as usual.

26:52.080 --> 26:52.960
Be extra cautious.

27:19.120 --> 27:20.360
Be on guard.

27:33.320 --> 27:36.120
It is fine. Genghui is here.
No petty villain can get close.

27:47.080 --> 27:48.800
Sir. All is well.

27:52.360 --> 27:54.720
Then I will send men
to deal with those ruffians.

27:54.800 --> 27:56.240
Do not send too many.

27:56.320 --> 27:57.440
It is clearly a ploy to lure us away.

28:01.720 --> 28:02.880
You all.

28:02.960 --> 28:03.880
Yes.

28:05.040 --> 28:07.640
Mr. Wuyin is unharmed.
Bring out two horses.

28:08.320 --> 28:11.240
Sir. The carriage is broken.
We should switch to horses.

28:11.960 --> 28:12.800
Very well.

28:17.720 --> 28:18.760
Let go of him.

28:21.560 --> 28:22.520
Let go of him now.

28:23.560 --> 28:25.560
If you do not want
your master to die, step aside.

28:28.720 --> 28:30.000
Tell them to move aside.

28:31.240 --> 28:33.360
-Stand down.
-Fall back.

28:38.840 --> 28:40.000
Out of the way!

28:51.960 --> 28:53.560
You are no ordinary servant.

28:54.160 --> 28:56.920
As long as you cooperate,
I will not harm you in the slightest.

30:06.680 --> 30:08.760
Young man, which way is the exit?

30:15.600 --> 30:16.880
Are you Tiemo people?

30:30.640 --> 30:32.880
The meteor iron from the altar
of Mount Shiluoman

30:32.960 --> 30:35.520
obtained through ritual,
is worn only by Tiemo nobles.

30:36.040 --> 30:37.880
Even if you changed into Han clothing,

30:37.960 --> 30:41.080
the meteor iron on your chest
is far too obvious.

30:46.760 --> 30:48.440
You know of Mount Shiluoman's altar.

30:49.200 --> 30:50.640
Are you Tiemo people as well?

30:57.120 --> 31:01.920
Lately Tiemo people are not very welcome
on the streets of Chang'an.

31:03.000 --> 31:03.840
Explain as we walk.

31:09.440 --> 31:10.640
Can you take me to Yankang Ward?

31:11.240 --> 31:12.320
You will be well rewarded.

31:16.080 --> 31:17.800
There are too many patrols at night.

31:17.880 --> 31:21.240
I dare not escort a Tiemo noble
down the street.

31:22.360 --> 31:23.840
Then take me in for the night.

31:23.920 --> 31:24.840
Send me there at dawn.

31:34.000 --> 31:36.120
Young man, just for one night.

31:36.200 --> 31:37.440
I will not treat you poorly.

31:46.240 --> 31:47.520
Chang'an is vast.

31:47.600 --> 31:48.960
Why dwell in such a shabby alley?

31:49.640 --> 31:52.960
For Tiemo people in Chang'an,
there are not many ways to make a living.

31:53.040 --> 31:57.480
Most days we sell a few leather goods,
and that's barely enough to get by.

31:58.080 --> 32:01.720
Times are unsettled now, so we moved here.

32:03.040 --> 32:04.960
We are almost there. Come on.

32:20.600 --> 32:23.280
Heads means enjoying wealth and honor.

32:23.800 --> 32:25.760
Tails means paying off the debt.

32:38.440 --> 32:39.600
I am Yang Chuhao of the Huben Army.

32:39.680 --> 32:41.040
I greet you, Mr. Wuyin.

32:43.760 --> 32:45.600
Do not fear, sir. You know me.

32:45.680 --> 32:47.560
I know you are Yang Chuhao.

32:47.640 --> 32:49.000
But you cannot appear out of nowhere.

32:49.080 --> 32:50.920
Anyone would be frightened.

32:51.000 --> 32:52.040
Who is he?

32:52.120 --> 32:55.360
He is with the people
who tried to seize you just now.

32:55.440 --> 32:56.280
A linked scheme.

33:00.320 --> 33:01.880
I almost fell for it.

33:01.960 --> 33:04.840
Sir, this place may not be safe.

33:04.920 --> 33:08.800
I should escort you away first,
then send people to eliminate them.

33:10.160 --> 33:11.840
It is fortunate you arrived in time.

33:12.440 --> 33:15.800
To protect you well,
I would give my life without hesitation.

33:15.880 --> 33:18.080
-Sir, please.
-Let us go.

33:25.680 --> 33:28.080
What is this? Did you bring a blade?

33:28.680 --> 33:29.720
No, no.

33:38.760 --> 33:40.040
-Yang Chuhao.
-Come.

33:40.120 --> 33:41.520
-Help me quickly.
-All right.

33:45.200 --> 33:46.160
So heavy.

33:51.920 --> 33:54.440
WARRANT

34:01.200 --> 34:02.120
This…

34:02.680 --> 34:05.360
All along the way
you kept telling me to be cautious.

34:05.440 --> 34:07.120
Chang'an truly sits in turmoil.

34:07.200 --> 34:10.400
Anyone who can set themselves
against the Huben Army… is him?

34:12.880 --> 34:13.880
It looks like…

34:13.960 --> 34:15.560
Yes, it must be him.

34:16.159 --> 34:19.159
This man has been wanted
by the Huben Army for 15 years.

34:20.639 --> 34:24.800
Mr. Wuyin, this time
you have made great merit.

34:26.360 --> 34:27.440
Genghui.

34:29.960 --> 34:31.960
Sir, this is…

34:32.040 --> 34:34.120
Say no more. Give me the blade.

34:38.199 --> 34:42.360
Since he is wanted by the Huben Army,
I shall claim this merit first.

34:43.040 --> 34:43.880
Sir, wait.

34:47.080 --> 34:50.760
Sir, he is Liu Ziwen's son.

34:50.840 --> 34:52.480
He is remarkably gifted.

34:53.080 --> 34:54.760
To kill him would be a waste.

34:55.360 --> 34:57.520
Alive, he is far more useful to us.

34:58.120 --> 34:59.240
General Fengshan still wants to see him.

34:59.920 --> 35:04.440
Yan Fengshan bears deep hatred for him,
and has him wanted across the city.

35:05.040 --> 35:07.000
Then take it as my gift to Yan Fengshan.

35:07.600 --> 35:08.640
Come.

35:09.800 --> 35:10.840
Sir, you were frightened.

35:13.040 --> 35:13.920
The carriage is here.

35:14.440 --> 35:18.520
I promise that from now on
you will not be disturbed again.

35:20.800 --> 35:21.800
Please, sir.

35:22.320 --> 35:23.880
-Carry him away.
-Yes.

35:30.080 --> 35:31.600
Was this also part of the plan?

35:38.680 --> 35:40.040
I do not know.

36:03.120 --> 36:07.040
When you read this letter,
I will likely already have been seized.

36:07.800 --> 36:09.400
But do not worry.

36:09.480 --> 36:11.520
The plan is still under control.

36:12.800 --> 36:14.320
As for why I arranged this,

36:15.240 --> 36:18.120
first, it is for my acquaintance
Yang Chuhao.

36:18.760 --> 36:21.000
The old debt he bore is repaid.

36:21.080 --> 36:22.600
He should not be implicated any further.

36:23.400 --> 36:24.720
By using this plan,

36:25.240 --> 36:27.600
I can win him some time
to break away from Yan Fengshan.

36:29.040 --> 36:31.960
Second, it is because of Ye Zheng.

36:32.480 --> 36:35.640
Your martial skills are strong,
but you lose your calm when you care.

36:36.400 --> 36:38.040
If you knew the entire plan,

36:39.120 --> 36:40.440
you would try to stop me.

36:42.880 --> 36:43.960
Third,

36:45.320 --> 36:46.400
when the Huben Army seizes me,

36:47.760 --> 36:52.320
the secret I carry can hold
Yan Fengshan's attention for a while.

36:52.400 --> 36:56.240
And that will be
our best chance to negotiate

36:56.320 --> 36:57.880
with the Tiemo envoy.

36:57.960 --> 37:01.400
The one going to negotiate
is already on the way.

37:39.840 --> 37:41.080
This plan may be dangerous…

37:41.160 --> 37:42.320
SPRING WINDS RISE. THE SWALLOW RETURNS.
THUNDER STIRS. LIGHTNING BEGINS.

37:42.400 --> 37:44.560
…but it is exactly what I wished for.

37:46.920 --> 37:49.560
To confront Yan Fengshan face to face is,

37:50.800 --> 37:54.520
in all my life,
the meeting I have anticipated most.
